[Term]
id: PAIN:0000040
name: chronic pain
def: "Pain that persists or recurs for longer than 3 months, in which each incidence of pain is attributed to the same underlying condition." [] {IAO:0000119="https://www.iasp-pain.org/advocacy/definitions-of-chronic-pain-syndromes/"}
comment: In many cases, the pain is initially caused by tissue damage or disease. The continuation of the pain is often the result of pathological changes in the central nervous system.
is_a: PAIN:0000128 ! temporally specified pain
intersection_of: PAIN:0000036 ! pain
intersection_of: RO:0000053 PATO:0001863
property_value: dc:contributor "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9625-1899" xsd:string
