[Term]
id: PAIN:0000043
name: nociplastic pain
def: "Pain that arises from altered nociception despite no clear evidence of actual or threatened tissue damage causing the activation of peripheral nociceptors or evidence for disease or lesion of the somatosensory system causing the pain." [] {IAO:0000119="https://www.iasp-pain.org/resources/terminology/"}
is_a: PAIN:0000132 ! neurobiological pain process
