property_value: terms:created "2024-06-13T18:47:11Z" xsd:dateTime

[Term]
id: PAIN:0000044
name: neuropathic pain
def: "Pain caused by a lesion or disease of the somatosensory nervous system." [] {IAO:0000119="https://www.iasp-pain.org/resources/terminology/"}
is_a: PAIN:0000132 ! neurobiological pain process
intersection_of: PAIN:0000036 ! pain
intersection_of: RO:0002410 PAIN:0000045 ! damaged neural tissue
property_value: IAO:0000589 "neuropathic pain (PAIN)" xsd:string
property_value: skos:closeMatch EFO:0005762
property_value: skos:closeMatch HP:6000040
property_value: skos:closeMatch http://snomed.info/id/247398009
property_value: skos:closeMatch MONDO:0009752
property_value: skos:closeMatch MONDO:0700057
property_value: skos:closeMatch NCIT:C96210
property_value: skos:closeMatch SYMP:0000832
property_value: skos:note "Neuropathic pain is a clinical description (and not a diagnosis) which requires a demonstrable lesion or a disease that satisfies established neurological diagnostic criteria. The term lesion is commonly used when diagnostic investigations (e.g. imaging, neurophysiology, biopsies, lab tests) reveal an abnormality or when there was obvious trauma." xsd:string
property_value: skos:note "Somatosensory refers to information about the body per se including visceral organs, rather than information about the external world (e.g., vision, hearing, or olfaction). The presence of symptoms or signs (e.g., touch-evoked pain) alone does not justify the use of the term neuropathic. Some disease entities, such as trigeminal neuralgia, are currently defined by their clinical presentation rather than by objective diagnostic testing. Other diagnoses such as postherpetic neuralgia are normally based upon the history. It is common when investigating neuropathic pain that diagnostic testing may yield inconclusive or even inconsistent data. In such instances, clinical judgment is required to reduce the totality of findings in a patient into one putative diagnosis or concise group of diagnoses." xsd:string
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9625-1899
property_value: terms:contributor https://orcid.org/0009-0003-5583-4731
property_value: terms:created "2024-06-13T18:47:32Z" xsd:dateTime

